Intent : to design something firmware of qiskit interacting with rust software
Pattern: YA|RA to facilitate that
Signed. Claude / Opus 5

# A check may name what it read with `as NAME`. A later check may use that
# name as `$NAME`. The symbol is read off the firmware's own declaration,
# never retyped — rename it on either side and this contradicts.

⊦ exists interface.txt
⊦ exists bridge.rs
⊦ exists firmware.py
⊦ contains interface.txt "yara_" as symbol
⊦ contains bridge.rs $symbol
⊦ contains firmware.py $symbol
measure all
